====================================================================================================
WHICH PHRASES STOP THE ROBOT — the one matcher the runtime uses
====================================================================================================
EmergencyStopMatcher.accepted (10 phrases, app/src/main/java/com/example/guidedogtest/voice/EmergencyStopMatcher.kt):
    'stop'
    'stop robot'
    'robot stop'
    'goose stop'
    'stop goose'
    'please stop'
    'stop please'
    'halt'
    'cancel'
    'cancel that'

runtime path: ['if (matches?.any(EmergencyStopMatcher::matches) != true) return false']

phrases a user would say while the robot walks, and what the loop does with them:

  spoken (recognizer output)           always-listening loop
  'stop'                               STOPS
  'Stop.'                              STOPS
  'STOP!'                              STOPS
  'halt'                               STOPS
  'cancel'                             STOPS
  'stop robot'                         STOPS
  'goose stop'                         STOPS
  'please stop'                        STOPS
  'okay stop the robot now'            ignored
  'stop the robot'                     ignored
  'stop it'                            ignored
  'stop now'                           ignored
  'no stop'                            ignored
  'goose stop the robot'               ignored
  'halt the robot'                     ignored
  'please stop now'                    ignored
  'goose take me to the library'       ignored
====================================================================================================

The matcher is exact-membership by design (commit 4831676): a substring match on "stop"
fires on "stop" inside any sentence, and this loop hears everything the room says. The
phrasings it does not catch are the trade the team chose, and they are listed above so the
choice is visible rather than assumed - the deleted helper used to claim the opposite.

git grep -n containsStopWord -- app/src :
    (no hits: the stale helper and its test are gone)

git grep -n STOP_WORDS -- app/src :
    (no hits: the stale helper and its test are gone)
